<title>DENMARK: ISS climbs on ISS Inc sale deal.</title>
<headline>ISS climbs on ISS Inc sale deal.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Danish cleaning group ISS soared six percent on Wednesday after the company announced a letter of intent to sell its troubled U.S. unit ISS Inc.</p>
<p>At 0855 GMT the share stood at 139 crowns, up from Tuesday's closing 131 crowns, having earlier touched 140.</p>
